  vortex_http_request_duration_seconds_paqir{marshrut,metod,le}

veb-rozetka o'lchagichlari:
  vortex_ws_connections{tugun}
  vortex_ws_fanout_queue_depth{xona,user}

Shaxsiy hisoblagichlar:
  vortex_messages_sent_jami{xona_turi}
  vorteks_chaqiriqlar_started_jami{turi}

