apns.h1_f:
POST https://api.push.apple.com/3/device/<device_token>
Sarlavhalar: apns-mavzu: <bundle_id>, apns-push-type: alert, apns-collapse-id: xona:42
Asosiy: {aps: {ogohlantirish: {nom, tana}}, ma'lumotlar: <muhrlangan>}

bmp.h1_f:
mailbox_id = HKDF(recipient_pubkey, info="bmp-v1", len=32)
Depozit: POST /bmp/depozit {mailbox_id, blob ≤1MB}
Olib ketish: GET /bmp/xabarlar (auth'd)

